[agent:result]         - A timedelta object
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]         This ttl value is added to the event time of the feature group and when the system time exceeds the event time + ttl, the entries will be automatically removed.
[agent:result]         The system time zone is in UTC.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]         By default, no TTL is set.
[agent:result]     ttl_enabled:
